# Repo docs that aren't needed in the packaged extension:
DEV-NOTES.md
DevChangelog.md
CLAUDE.md
patch.js
*.zip

# README.md is the engineer-facing GitHub version. The Marketplace details
# page is fed by README.marketplace.md via `vsce package --readme-path …`,
# whose content is injected as the package's README.md. Excluding the
# engineer version here avoids shipping it inside the .vsix.
README.md

# Screenshots are for the GitHub README only:
media/Screenshot*.png

# Local Claude Code config (skills, settings) — never ship to Marketplace:
.claude/**
